+| `plan_edit` | Patch-oriented planning bundle for likely edit files, candidate spans, affected callers/dependencies, docs, and recommended tests. | `query` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Edit-planning workflow bundle with spans, impacted symbols, docs, tests, risks, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/plan_edit.rs` |
+| `trace_scenario` | Scenario-debugging bundle that traces likely execution paths, guards, side effects, and failure branches. | `scenario` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Scenario workflow bundle with paths, branches, guards, risks, context, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/trace_scenario.rs` |
+| `find_relevant_tests` | Finds tests most relevant to files, symbols, or a diff. | Optional `files`, `symbols`, `diff`, `limit`. | Ranked test list with reasons and structured payload. | Structured response; context handle is stored for expansion. | `limit` bounds results. | generic events; workflow metadata for v2 bundle. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/relevant_tests.rs` |
