+| `find_stale_docs` | Finds Markdown docs or sections likely stale against changed files or symbols. | Optional `files`, `symbols`, `limit`. | Stale-doc candidates with reasons and related symbols/files. | Structured response with doc/section targets. | `limit` bounds candidates. | generic events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` |
+| `diagnose_failure` | First failure tool for compiler errors, failing tests, and stack traces. | `input` required; optional `kind`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Failure workflow bundle with suspects, related code, tests, next steps, diagnostics, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/diagnose_failure.rs` |
