+| `delete_observation` | Deletes a stored observation by id. | `id` required. | Delete confirmation. | Structured response. | No explicit budget. | generic events; memory lifecycle path. | Redesigned-with-shim. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` |
+| `update_observation` | Updates observation content in place and clears stale flags. | `id`, `content` required. | Updated memory metadata. | Structured response. | No explicit budget. | generic events; memory update path. | Redesigned-with-shim. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` |
