+# MCP Tool Reference
+
+This document is the canonical Phase 8 MCP tool listing for the cognitive workspace fork. It implements the contract requested by [## MCP Surface](../plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#mcp-surface), [## MCP Tool Contract Principles](../plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#mcp-tool-contract-principles), and [## Phase 8: Workflow Engine V2](../plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#phase-8-workflow-engine-v2). Collapse decisions and shim rationale are recorded in [MCP Surface Audit](./2026-05-16-mcp-surface-audit.md). Compatibility and removal rules come from [MCP Compatibility Policy](./2026-05-16-mcp-compatibility-policy.md).
+
+Implementation source of truth: advertised tools are assembled in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs::handle_tools_list`; callable names are dispatched in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs::handle_tools_call`.
+
+## Final tool list
+
+Legend: `generic events` means the daemon records `ToolCalled` and `ToolResult` when event capture is enabled. `workflow events` means the workflow response also carries the Phase 8 standard sequence `AssistantTaskStarted`, `ToolCalled`, `ContextBundleReturned`, `MemoryRetrieved`, and `PlanCreated` in its workflow event metadata.
+
+| Tool | Description | Request schema summary | Response schema summary | Render modes and handles | Budget controls | Phase 2 events | Deprecation status | Implementing file |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `get_context_capsule` | First discovery tool for unfamiliar code areas; returns ranked source pivots, nearby symbols, reusable handle, and suggested expansion. | `query` required; optional `mode`, `render`. | Overview, pivots, context, memory highlights, stats, `context_handle`, `suggested_expand`, structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=full/focused`; emits context handle and expansion target. | Focused mode bounds pivots/context; render options shape payload. | generic events; workflow response metadata. | Stable canonical; `query_context` callable alias. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/context_capsule.rs` |
+| `prepare_change` | First workflow tool for fix/add/refactor work once the area is known; returns likely edit files, symbols, tests, risks, and memory. | `query` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Workflow bundle with ranked pivots, context, tests, risks, memory, events, handle, and structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget=tiny/compact/full`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/prepare_change.rs` |
+| `plan_edit` | Patch-oriented planning bundle for likely edit files, candidate spans, affected callers/dependencies, docs, and recommended tests. | `query` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Edit-planning workflow bundle with spans, impacted symbols, docs, tests, risks, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/plan_edit.rs` |
+| `trace_scenario` | Scenario-debugging bundle that traces likely execution paths, guards, side effects, and failure branches. | `scenario` required; optional `entry_files`, `entry_symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Scenario workflow bundle with paths, branches, guards, risks, context, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/trace_scenario.rs` |
+| `find_relevant_tests` | Finds tests most relevant to files, symbols, or a diff. | Optional `files`, `symbols`, `diff`, `limit`. | Ranked test list with reasons and structured payload. | Structured response; context handle is stored for expansion. | `limit` bounds results. | generic events; workflow metadata for v2 bundle. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/relevant_tests.rs` |
+| `impact_from_diff` | Reviews a local diff for changed symbols, downstream impact, risks, checklist, and tests. | `diff` required; optional `files`, `symbols`, `hops`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Impact workflow bundle with changed symbols, dependent paths, risks, tests, docs, memory, events, and handle. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `hops`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events; workflow metadata. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/impact_from_diff.rs` |
+| `get_working_set_context` | Compresses already-known files/symbols into a bundle of nearby code, docs, tests, and memory. | Optional `files`, `symbols`, `query`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Working-set workflow bundle with pivots, context, tests, docs, memory, risks, handle, and structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` |
+| `summarize_subsystem` | Summary-first map for an unfamiliar subsystem with key files, symbols, tests, and durable memory. | `query` required; optional `files`, `symbols`, `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Subsystem summary bundle with files, symbols, tests, memory, risks, handle, and structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`; handle plus expansion target. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` |
+| `get_repo_playbook` | Repo-wide startup summary of architecture, conventions, high-signal files, and durable patterns. | Optional `mode`, `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`, `render`. | Playbook bundle with architecture summary, conventions, files, memory, and structured payload. | `render=json/markdown/hybrid`; `mode=auto/compact/full`. | `budget`, `max_tokens`, `wire_format`. | generic events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` |
+| `get_docs_capsule` | Finds relevant Markdown docs and sections for a question, plus code symbols mentioned from those docs. | `query` required; optional `files`, `symbols`, `limit`. | Ranked docs/sections, related symbols, reasons, and expansion handle. | Structured response with stable doc/section expansion targets. | `limit` bounds docs. | generic events. | Stable canonical. | `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/workflow_v2/docs_capsule.rs` |
